<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Endesa 96 net seen up 12.2 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Endesa 96 net seen up 12.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish electricity firm Endesa. Simple averages of analysts' forecasts. In billion of pesetas.</p>
<p>				  1996	RANGE	  1995</p>
<p>   Revenues		  875.69   918.9-829.2   861.69</p>
<p>   Net attributable	168.19   170.0-165.9   149.85</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, BBV interactivos, ABN-Amro, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Beta Capital, Credit Lyonnais, Ibersecurities.</p>
<p>Endesa has not yet set a date to report its results.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
